   "source": [
    "# ecallistolib Complete Tutorial\n",
    "\n",
    "A comprehensive guide to the **ecallistolib** library for working with e-CALLISTO solar radio spectrograms.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Table of Contents\n",
    "\n",
    "1. [Reading FITS Files](#1-reading-fits-files)\n",
    "2. [Downloading Data](#2-downloading-data)\n",
    "3. [Processing Data](#3-processing-data)\n",
    "4. [Cropping & Slicing](#4-cropping--slicing)\n",
    "5. [Combining Spectra](#5-combining-spectra)\n",
    "6. [Plotting](#6-plotting)\n",
    "7. [Time Axis Conversion](#7-time-axis-conversion)\n",
    "8. [Light Curve Plotting](#8-light-curve-plotting)\n",
    "9. [Complete Workflow](#9-complete-workflow)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import ecallistolib as ecl\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "from datetime import date\n",
    "\n",
    "%matplotlib inline"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. Reading FITS Files\n",
    "\n",
    "The `read_fits()` function loads e-CALLISTO FITS files into a `DynamicSpectrum` object."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Data shape: (200, 3600) (n_freq, n_time)\n",
      "Frequency range: 15.0 - 86.6 MHz\n",
      "Time range: 0.0 - 899.8 seconds\n",
      "Source file: /Users/saan/Desktop/ecallistolib/data/Arecibo-Observatory_20220430_134501_63.fit.gz\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# Read a FITS file\n",
    "ds = ecl.read_fits(\"/Users/saan/Desktop/ecallistolib/data/Arecibo-Observatory_20220430_134501_63.fit.gz\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Explore the DynamicSpectrum object\n",
    "print(f\"Data shape: {ds.shape} (n_freq, n_time)\")\n",
    "print(f\"Frequency range: {ds.freqs_mhz.min():.1f} - {ds.freqs_mhz.max():.1f} MHz\")\n",
    "print(f\"Time range: {ds.time_s.min():.1f} - {ds.time_s.max():.1f} seconds\")\n",
    "print(f\"Source file: {ds.source}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Metadata:\n",
      "  ut_start_sec: 49501.186\n",
      "  observation_start: 2022-04-30 13:45:01+00:00\n",
      "  observation_end: 2022-04-30 14:00:00.750000+00:00\n",
      "  station: Arecibo-Observatory\n",
      "  date: 20220430\n",
      "  time: 134501\n",
      "  focus: 63\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# View metadata extracted from the file\n",
    "print(\"Metadata:\")\n",
    "for key, value in ds.meta.items():\n",
    "    print(f\"  {key}: {value}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
